<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>BilimSari — Bilim sari qadam</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/logo-icon-32.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="assets/logo-icon-64.png">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #fff;
      color: #111;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }

    /* ========== HEADER ========== */
    .header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .logo img {
      height: 36px;
      width: auto;
      display: block;
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .nav a {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #444;
      transition: color .2s;
    }

    .nav a:hover { color: #e34c3e; }

    .nav-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 40px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: .2s ease;
      border: none;
    }

    .btn-ghost {
      background: transparent;
      color: #111;
    }

    .btn-ghost:hover { background: #f5f5f5; }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #e34c3e;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover { background: #c93d30; }

    .btn-dark {
      background: #171717;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-dark:hover { background: #000; }

    .menu-toggle {
      display: none;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 6px;
    }

    .menu-toggle svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; }

    /* ========== HERO ========== */
    .hero {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 72px 24px 80px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: #fff5f4;
      color: #e34c3e;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 48px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -1.2px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .hero h1 span { color: #e34c3e; }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #555;
      max-width: 480px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .hero-visual {
      background: #fafafa;
      border: 1px solid #eee;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 320px;
    }

    .hero-visual img {
      width: 180px;
      height: auto;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    /* ========== FEATURES ========== */
    .features {
      background: #fafafa;
      border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
      padding: 72px 24px;
    }

    .features-inner {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.8px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .section-title p {
      color: #666;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #eee;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      transition: .2s ease;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fff5f4;
      color: #e34c3e;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* ========== CTA ========== */
    .cta {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 80px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.8px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .cta p {
      color: #555;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    /* ========== FOOTER ========== */
    .footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .footer-logo img {
      height: 28px;
    }

    .footer-copy {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #888;
    }

    /* ========== MOBILE ========== */
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .nav { display: none; }

      .menu-toggle { display: block; }

      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 48px 20px 56px;
        gap: 36px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .hero h1 { font-size: 36px; }

      .hero p { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

      .hero-actions { justify-content: center; }

      .hero-visual { min-height: 220px; padding: 28px; }

      .hero-visual img { width: 130px; }

      .features-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        max-width: 420px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .section-title h2,
      .cta h2 { font-size: 26px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .header-inner { padding: 12px 16px; }
      .logo img { height: 30px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 30px; }
      .btn { height: 44px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <header class="header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a href="index.html" class="logo">
        <img src="assets/logo-full.png" alt="BilimSari">
      </a>

      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="index.html">Bosh sahifa</a>
        <a href="#features">Imkoniyatlar</a>
        <a href="#cta">Kurslar</a>
      </nav>

      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a href="login.html" class="btn btn-ghost">Kirish</a>
        <a href="register.html" class="btn btn-primary">Ro‘yxatdan o‘tish</a>
        <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Menu" onclick="toggleMenu()">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span>📚</span> O‘zbek tilida bilim platformasi
      </div>
      <h1>Bilim sari<br><span>birga yuraylik</span></h1>
      <p>
        BilimSari — o‘quvchilar va o‘qituvchilar uchun zamonaviy ta’lim platformasi.
        Kurslar, testlar va bilimlarni bir joyda to‘plang.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="register.html" class="btn btn-primary">Boshlash</a>
        <a href="#features" class="btn btn-dark">Ko‘proq bilish</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
      <img src="assets/logo-icon.png" alt="BilimSari kitob">
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURES -->
  <section class="features" id="features">
    <div class="features-inner">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Nima uchun BilimSari?</h2>
        <p>Oddiy, qulay va samarali ta’lim tajribasi</p>
      </div>

      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📖</div>
          <h3>Kurslar va darslar</h3>
          <p>Turli fanlar bo‘yicha tuzilgan kurslar. Har bir dars aniq va tushunarli.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">✅</div>
          <h3>Testlar va mashqlar</h3>
          <p>O‘zlashtirgan bilimingizni darhol tekshiring. Natijalar saqlanadi.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">👨‍🏫</div>
          <h3>O‘qituvchilar uchun</h3>
          <p>O‘z kurslaringizni yarating, o‘quvchilarni kuzating va baho bering.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta" id="cta">
    <h2>Hozirroq boshlang</h2>
    <p>Hisob yarating va bilim olishni bugundan boshlang</p>
    <a href="register.html" class="btn btn-primary" style="height:48px; padding:0 28px; font-size:15px;">
      Ro‘yxatdan o‘tish
    </a>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <a href="index.html" class="footer-logo">
        <img src="assets/logo-full.png" alt="BilimSari">
      </a>
      <div class="footer-copy">© 2026 BilimSari. Barcha huquqlar himoyalangan.</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="js/auth.js"></script>
  <script>
    // Login qilmagan foydalanuvchini login sahifasiga yuborish
    requireAuth();

    function toggleMenu() {
      // Hozircha oddiy — keyinroq mobile menu qo‘shiladi
      alert('Mobil menyu keyingi bosqichda qo‘shiladi');
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
